# Shared airline definitions

> Module Definitions

Shared types, passenger and baggage facts, and geographic helpers for an airline
itinerary. Item dimensions are in inches, weights are in pounds, and monetary
amounts are in U.S. dollars.

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration Cabin: # The passenger's ticketed cabin or fare category.
  -- BasicEconomy # Basic Economy fare.
  -- MainCabin # Main Cabin fare.
  -- MainPlus # Main Plus fare.
  -- PremiumEconomy # Premium Economy cabin.
  -- Business # Business cabin.
  -- First # First cabin.

declaration enumeration Country: # Country, territory, or geographic region of an itinerary endpoint; Europe is represented as one region.
  -- UnitedStates
  -- PuertoRico
  -- Canada
  -- USVirginIslands
  -- Mexico
  -- Honduras
  -- Guyana
